## 3. Migration Mapping

### 3.1 `causes` → `donation_profiles`

| v1.0 Column (`causes`) | v2.0 Column (`donation_profiles`) | Transformation |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | `id` | Direct copy (preserve UUID) |
| `title` | `title` | Direct copy |
| `description` | `description` | Direct copy |
| `target_amount` | `target_amount` | Direct copy |
| `raised_amount` | `raised_amount` | Direct copy |
| `image_url` | `image_url` | Direct copy |
| `is_active` | `is_active` | Direct copy |
| `created_at` | `created_at` | Direct copy |
| `updated_at` | `updated_at` | Direct copy |
| — | `creator_id` | Set to migrated admin user ID |
| — | `category` | Set to 'general' |
| — | `verification_status` | Set to 'verified' (pre-existing = trusted) |
| — | `start_date` | Set to `created_at` |
| — | `end_date` | NULL |

### 3.2 `admin_users` → `users`

| v1.0 Column (`admin_users`) | v2.0 Column (`users`) | Transformation |
|---|---|---|
| `id` | `id` | Direct copy (preserve UUID) |
| `email` | `email` | Direct copy |
| `name` | `name` | Direct copy |
| — | `phone` | NULL |
| `role` | `role` | Map: 'admin' → 'admin' |
| — | `avatar_url` | NULL |
| `supabase_auth_id` | `supabase_auth_id` | Direct copy |
| — | `is_active` | true |
| `created_at` | `created_at` | Direct copy |
| `updated_at` | `updated_at` | Direct copy |

### 3.3 `donations` — Add New Columns

| New Column | Default Value | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `campaign_id` | Mapped from `cause_id` → `donation_profiles.id` | FK to new table |
| `donor_user_id` | NULL | v1.0 donors were anonymous |
| `is_anonymous` | false | Default for existing donations |
| `subscription_id` | NULL | No subscriptions in v1.0 |
| `receipt_id` | NULL | No receipts in v1.0 |

