## 6. Data Validation Checklist

### Pre-Migration
- [ ] Full database backup created
- [ ] v1.0 record counts noted (causes, donations, admin_users)
- [ ] v1.0 Edge Functions tested and operational

### Post-Migration
- [ ] `users` count matches `admin_users` count
- [ ] `donation_profiles` count matches `causes` count
- [ ] All `donation_profiles` have `verification_status = 'verified'`
- [ ] All `donations.campaign_id` populated (where `cause_id` exists)
- [ ] No orphaned donations (campaign_id points to valid profile)
- [ ] Original `causes` table intact and unchanged
- [ ] Original `donations` table columns intact
- [ ] Original `admin_users` table intact
- [ ] v1.0 Edge Functions still operational (test create-order)
- [ ] `get_donation_stats()` function still works
- [ ] RLS policies on v1.0 tables unchanged

### Data Integrity Checks

```sql
-- Check 1: No data loss
SELECT 'users' AS table_name, COUNT(*) AS count FROM users
UNION ALL
SELECT 'admin_users', COUNT(*) FROM admin_users
UNION ALL
SELECT 'donation_profiles', COUNT(*) FROM donation_profiles
UNION ALL
SELECT 'causes', COUNT(*) FROM causes
UNION ALL
SELECT 'donations', COUNT(*) FROM donations;

-- Check 2: All donations linked to campaigns
SELECT COUNT(*) AS unlinked_donations
FROM donations
WHERE cause_id IS NOT NULL AND campaign_id IS NULL;
-- Expected: 0

-- Check 3: All migrated profiles are verified
SELECT COUNT(*) AS non_verified_migrated
FROM donation_profiles
WHERE verification_status != 'verified'
AND id IN (SELECT id FROM causes);
-- Expected: 0

-- Check 4: Financial totals match
SELECT
    (SELECT SUM(amount) FROM donations WHERE status = 'completed') AS v1_total,
    (SELECT SUM(raised_amount) FROM donation_profiles) AS v2_total;
-- These should match or be close
```

